      "name": "Sticky · Color roles should come from Hemlock",
      "opacity": 0.5,
      "width": 250,
      "height": 219,
      "content": "The color roles (Node ID: w7Te6) should reference more than what it's referencing now, because, for instance, there will be more categorical chart colors than just the 5 shown here. And in fact, do we need it all if everything here should be referencing the hemlock library? Devs have that hemlock library. we really just need what each component is spec'd with (including text components). The tokens should not be straying at all from the hemlock system and if they are, tell me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "s9QWo",
      "x": 4044,
