    {
      "type": "context",
      "id": "nM8Nd",
      "x": 2952,
      "y": 10718,
      "name": "Tokens & type in this file",
      "width": 340,
      "height": 0,
      "content": "Tokens & type in this file\n\nDark is the default theme. The Light feed copy exists only to check that every color flips through tokens.\n\nColor, spacing, radius, and type-size bindings come from Hemlock (g: alias), with exceptions: some components still hardcode spacing values, and a few borrow nav or chat tokens. 02 Not in Hemlock (in the library) lists the few gaps. The only local tokens are font-ui and nav-themeToggleIcon.\n\nfont-ui = Gothic A1 is an exploration stand-in for $g:font-primary (Heebo). To ship with Heebo, point font-ui at $g:font-primary; nothing else changes. Hemlock components inside canvases carry a fontFamily override to font-ui for the same reason.\n\nMeta text binds $g:sem-text-meta. In dark it measures 3.8:1 on sem-background-elevated and 4.3:1 on sem-background-main, under AA for small text. The fix is in progress in Hemlock; every meta role here is bound to the token, so the new value flows through."
    },
