              "id": "DGBqf",
              "name": "Desc",
              "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "The answer area of the Q&A question card. Each control is a component whose root fills the card's width, so it drops into the card's answer slot at any feed width; pills and radios keep their own size inside it. The card itself (QUESTION N, the question, helper text, Skip / Continue) is designed separately. Everything is built from Hemlock Button, Radio, Checkbox, and Slider instances, with labels overridden to $g:font-primary. A selected choice keeps Hemlock's pressed-outline look at rest, the same rule as Canvas / Save Button / Saved. Backdrops stand in for the card's content area: Hemlock Card tokens, 488 wide inside, as in the feed.",
              "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
              "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
              "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
