                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IqLwb",
                  "name": "Flag 1",
                  "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Slider: Hemlock's Slider is a fixed 320 frame with no layout, so it can't fill the card. Each instance switches it to horizontal layout with Track at fill_container and Fill and Thumb absolute. Hemlock should make Slider stretch.",
                  "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "f6Miz",
                  "name": "Flag 2",
                  "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Checked marks: Radio/checked and Checkbox/checked draw the ring, dot, and tick in sem-borders-focus, which is #7094FB at 35% in dark: 1.8:1 on sem-background-elevated, under the 3:1 for UI states. Unchecked rings and boxes use sem-borders-dark: 1.4:1 light, 1.2:1 dark.",
                  "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dEIKz",
                  "name": "Flag 3",
                  "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Selected pill: Hemlock Button has no selected state, so Yes-No / Selected shows /pressed at rest, the same as Canvas / Save Button / Saved (open decision in spec §10).",
                  "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "hoX31",
                  "name": "Flag 4",
                  "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Selected tile border: sem-btnSecondaryBorderPressed is a button token. The semantic sem-borders-action-subtle is navy-50 in dark (1.5:1 on the highlight fill), and sem-borders-action is blue-600 in light, which isn't subtle.",
                  "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LYJXT",
                  "name": "Flag 5",
                  "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Sizes: Radio and Checkbox labels use Hemlock's small size (text-size-sm / line-height-sm) to match the md pill labels. md pills and stepper buttons are 36 tall; Hemlock's tap target is 44, so pad the hit area in code.",
                  "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
                  "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
                  "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
