              "name": "Desc",
              "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Live on every canvas screen. Ranks get a soft square (radius-3xs, sem-background-subtle) with a semibold serif numeral. Numbered lists keep the round Number Marker. Takeaways drop numbers for a Lucide icon picked by meaning, in sem-icons-info-strong with no fill: 24px on desktop, 20px on phones, where the lead steps down to 18px. Everything binds a Hemlock token; the 24px square and the icon sizes are fixed sizes because Hemlock has no size tokens.",
              "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
              "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
              "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
