              "fill": "$g:sem-text-meta",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Built from the live masters: Canvas / Ranked Row (G1aer3), Canvas / List Item / Number (d9CFwF), Canvas / Takeaway (y3LxQD) and Canvas / Takeaway / Mobile. The canvases on the screens show one takeaway; three are shown here so each icon has a job.",
