              "content": "03 · TAKEAWAY ICONS · LUCIDE, PICKED BY THE TAKEAWAY'S TOPIC · 36 TOPICS ACROSS EVERY KIND OF MONEY QUESTION",
              "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-2xs",
              "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
