            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "r85ok6",
              "name": "Desc",
              "fill": "$g:sem-text-body",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Blocks for answers that are mostly words. Paragraph wraps Type / Body at the 680 measure, with an optional H3. A list marker sits on the first line of its item, pinned to the item's top-left, and the text is inset, so wrapped lines align with the text instead of the marker. Markers are structure, not actions, so they never take the link blue: bullets are a small diamond, the logo's dot, in sem-icons-info-strong, the info accent; numbers use Canvas / Number Marker, the Ranked Row's soft disc, so every numbered thing on a canvas looks the same. An item with a lead stacks a 600 lead line over the body. Rhythm: blocks inside a section sit spacing-sm apart; list items spacing-2xs (spacing-sm when they have leads); a section (an H2 and its blocks) sits spacing-lg from the next. On narrow views every block fills the column. Every value is a Hemlock token; UI type binds $g:font-primary.",
              "lineHeight": "$g:line-height-sm",
              "fontFamily": "$g:font-primary",
              "fontSize": "$g:text-size-sm",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
